  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 985ba504872e84baab0d05c9acbfb044, type: 3}
  m_Name: IntroStoryData
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  pages:
  - "Hollowvale bir zamanlar \u0131\u015F\u0131\u011F\u0131n, \u015Fark\u0131lar\u0131n
    ve b\xFCy\xFCn\xFCn kasabas\u0131yd\u0131.\n\u015Eimdi ise ad\u0131n\u0131 bile
    f\u0131s\u0131ldamaya \xE7ekinenlerin b\u0131rakt\u0131\u011F\u0131 bir sisin
    i\xE7inde uyuyor.\nO gece, g\xF6ky\xFCz\xFC ay \u0131\u015F\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    saklad\u0131.\nKasaban\u0131n fenerleri tek tek s\xF6nd\xFC.\nVe herkesin kalbinden
    ayn\u0131 \u015Fey kopar\u0131ld\u0131: hat\u0131rlamak.\n"
  - "Karanl\u0131k bir b\xFCy\xFC, kasaban\u0131n eski b\xFCy\xFCc\xFClerini bedenlerinden
    ay\u0131rd\u0131;\ngeriye yaln\u0131zca ta\u015Flara, mezarlara ve k\u0131r\u0131k
    evlere tutunan kay\u0131p ruhlar kald\u0131.\nHollowvale\u2019in laneti, sessizli\u011Fini
    b\xF6yle \xF6rd\xFC.\n"
  - "Luna, bu sisin i\xE7inden geri d\xF6nen tek ki\u015Fiydi.\nGen\xE7 bir cad\u0131
    \xE7\u0131ra\u011F\u0131\u2026 i\xE7indeki \u0131\u015F\u0131\u011F\u0131 s\xF6nd\xFCrmemeye
    yeminli.\n\nHer kurtar\u0131lan ruh, Luna\u2019ya yaln\u0131zca yeni bir b\xFCy\xFC
    de\u011Fil;\nayn\u0131 zamanda kasaban\u0131n saklad\u0131\u011F\u0131 bir ger\xE7e\u011Fi
    de f\u0131s\u0131ldayacak.\n\nVe yolun sonunda, Karanl\u0131k B\xFCy\xFCc\xFC
    ile y\xFCzle\u015Fmek ka\xE7\u0131n\u0131lmaz.\nBaz\u0131 ruhlar\u2026 yaln\u0131zca
    hat\u0131rland\u0131klar\u0131nda \xF6zg\xFCr kal\u0131r.\n"
